		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A corrosive firearm round that Sunders armor.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3, Damage: STRd4. On damage: inflict Sundered. Affected targets can spend an action to remove the condition.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> On damage: inflict Sundered for 2 attacks.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Acid damage you deal ignores Medium Armor.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Acid Shell gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Acid Shell (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: Acid damage you deal ignores Medium Armor.</em></p>",
